  <name>Last Watched</name>
  <summary
    >Dolphin integration for revision control systems, Dropbox, and disk images</summary>
  <description>
    <p
        >These plugins integrate Dolphin with the revision control systems Bazaar, Mercurial and Git.  A Dropbox plugin gives action items to keep your files synced to the Dropbox service. A disk image integration plugin adds a mount or unmount action.</p>
  </description>
